From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Derek Ross <derekross@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 11 Oct 2026 18:17:21 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] scsi: ufs: exynos: add Google gs201 support

Add support for the UFS host controller of the Google gs201 (Tensor G2)
SoC. It is the gs101 controller, and the gs101 callbacks are reused,
with two differences, both taken from Google's GPL-2.0 gs201 sources:

 1. Descriptor quirks. Google's gs201-ufs.dtsi sets
    "fixed-prdt-req_list-ocs" ("UTRD bug fixed"); gs101-ufs.dtsi doesn't,
    and that is the only difference between the two host nodes. The same
    property is in the device tree the bootloader hands over on a Pixel
    7 Pro. When it is present, Google's driver (ufs-exynos.c,
    exynos_ufs_set_features()) clears UFSHCD_QUIRK_PRDT_BYTE_GRAN,
    UFSHCI_QUIRK_BROKEN_REQ_LIST_CLR, UFSHCD_QUIRK_BROKEN_OCS_FATAL_ERROR
    and UFSHCI_QUIRK_SKIP_RESET_INTR_AGGR. gs201 therefore uses the
    gs101 quirks minus those four. Byte-granular UTRD offsets would make
    the controller fetch the response UPIU and PRDT from the wrong
    place.

 2. Reference clock. gs201 boards use a 38.4 MHz UFS reference clock
    (gs201/ufs-cal.h: USE_UFS_REFCLK = USE_38_4_MHZ). For that clock,
    init_cfg_evt{0,1}[] in gs201/ufs-cal-if.c program PCS attribute 0x202
    to 0x2 inside the 0x200 = 0x40 window. gs101's tables have no such
    row. gs201_ufs_pre_link() does that write, then runs the gs101
    sequence.

Everything else matches gs101. Google uses one SoC-independent host
driver for both. The IO-coherency register is HSI2 sysreg 0x710 with mask
0x3 (gs201-ufs.dtsi ufs-iocc). The bootloader-provided tree on a Pixel 7
Pro shows the same values, and the stock kernel log reports a 177.664 MHz
UniPro clock with two lanes at HS-G4 rate B.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 drivers/ufs/host/ufs-exynos.c | 33 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 1 file changed, 33 insertions(+)

diff --git a/drivers/ufs/host/ufs-exynos.c b/drivers/ufs/host/ufs-exynos.c
index b2f65c465..033d6c419 100644
--- a/drivers/ufs/host/ufs-exynos.c
+++ b/drivers/ufs/host/ufs-exynos.c
@@ -2083,6 +2083,18 @@ static int gs101_ufs_post_link(struct exynos_ufs *ufs)
 	return 0;
 }
 
+static int gs201_ufs_pre_link(struct exynos_ufs *ufs)
+{
+	struct ufs_hba *hba = ufs->hba;
+
+	/* Program the PCS for the 38.4 MHz reference clock used on gs201 */
+	ufshcd_dme_set(hba, UIC_ARG_MIB(0x200), 0x40);
+	ufshcd_dme_set(hba, UIC_ARG_MIB(0x202), 0x02);
+	ufshcd_dme_set(hba, UIC_ARG_MIB(0x200), 0x0);
+
+	return gs101_ufs_pre_link(ufs);
+}
+
 static int gs101_ufs_pre_pwr_change(struct exynos_ufs *ufs,
 					 struct ufs_pa_layer_attr *pwr)
 {
@@ -2294,6 +2306,25 @@ static const struct exynos_ufs_drv_data gs101_ufs_drvs = {
 	.suspend		= gs101_ufs_suspend,
 };
 
+/*
+ * gs201 fixed the PRDT, request list clear and OCS issues of gs101: its UTRD
+ * offsets and lengths follow the UFSHCI specification.
+ */
+static const struct exynos_ufs_drv_data gs201_ufs_drvs = {
+	.uic_attr		= &gs101_uic_attr,
+	.quirks			= UFSHCI_QUIRK_SKIP_MANUAL_WB_FLUSH_CTRL |
+				  UFSHCD_QUIRK_SKIP_DEF_UNIPRO_TIMEOUT_SETTING,
+	.opts			= EXYNOS_UFS_OPT_SKIP_CONFIG_PHY_ATTR |
+				  EXYNOS_UFS_OPT_UFSPR_SECURE |
+				  EXYNOS_UFS_OPT_TIMER_TICK_SELECT,
+	.iocc_mask		= UFS_GS101_SHARABLE,
+	.drv_init		= gs101_ufs_drv_init,
+	.pre_link		= gs201_ufs_pre_link,
+	.post_link		= gs101_ufs_post_link,
+	.pre_pwr_change		= gs101_ufs_pre_pwr_change,
+	.suspend		= gs101_ufs_suspend,
+};
+
 static const struct exynos_ufs_drv_data exynosautov920_ufs_drvs = {
 	.uic_attr               = &exynos7_uic_attr,
 	.quirks                 = UFSHCD_QUIRK_SKIP_DEF_UNIPRO_TIMEOUT_SETTING,
@@ -2312,6 +2343,8 @@ static const struct exynos_ufs_drv_data exynosautov920_ufs_drvs = {
 static const struct of_device_id exynos_ufs_of_match[] = {
 	{ .compatible = "google,gs101-ufs",
 	  .data	      = &gs101_ufs_drvs },
+	{ .compatible = "google,gs201-ufs",
+	  .data	      = &gs201_ufs_drvs },
 	{ .compatible = "samsung,exynos7-ufs",
 	  .data	      = &exynos_ufs_drvs },
 	{ .compatible = "samsung,exynosautov9-ufs",
